{"nodes": [{"id": "brain_log_61_r3_conformal_upper_bound_result_r3_conformal_upper_bound", "label": "R3 \u2014 the conformal upper bound, gated on its condition", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "brain/log/61_R3_conformal_upper_bound_result.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "brain_log_61_r3_conformal_upper_bound_result_angelopoulos_conformal_2023", "label": "angelopoulos_conformal_2023 \u2014 Theorem D.2", "file_type": "paper", "source_file": "brain/log/61_R3_conformal_upper_bound_result.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "brain_log_61_r3_conformal_upper_bound_result_conformal_upper_bound", "label": "Conformal calibration upper bound 1-alpha+1/(n+1)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "brain/log/61_R3_conformal_upper_bound_result.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Withheld at all three venues, not only Ellel: the upper limb requires a continuous score distribution and |actual-forecast| carries a genuine atom at 0 on structurally closed days."}, {"id": "brain_log_61_r3_conformal_upper_bound_result_score_ties", "label": "score_ties() \u2014 tie fraction in the calibration scores", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "brain/log/61_R3_conformal_upper_bound_result.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "brain_log_61_r3_conformal_upper_bound_result_atom_at_zero", "label": "Structural atom at score 0", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "brain/log/61_R3_conformal_upper_bound_result.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The paper's remedy (vanishing random noise) addresses incidental ties only; no vanishing noise recovers continuity from a point mass, it only hides it."}, {"id": "brain_log_61_r3_conformal_upper_bound_result_lower_bound_limb", "label": "The lower bound limb (unaffected by ties)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "brain/log/61_R3_conformal_upper_bound_result.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Its proof handles ties, and it is the limb every under-coverage claim in this project rests on."}, {"id": "brain_log_61_r3_conformal_upper_bound_result_environment_sensitivity", "label": "eval/interval_calibration is environment-sensitive", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "brain/log/61_R3_conformal_upper_bound_result.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Deterministic within a venv but numpy 1.26/pandas 2.3 (.venv-eval) and numpy 2.5/pandas 3.0 (.venv-forecast) give different coverages and Winkler scores; the committed artefact carried no stamp saying which."}, {"id": "brain_log_61_r3_conformal_upper_bound_result_provenance_stamp_recommendation", "label": "Recommendation: stamp the artefact's library resolution", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "brain/log/61_R3_conformal_upper_bound_result.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "This is precisely the gap provenance.py was created to close; any regeneration from the wrong venv would silently restate every figure in tab:winkler."}, {"id": "brain_log_61_r3_conformal_upper_bound_result_d_f1", "label": "D-F1 \u2014 conformance row R16", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "brain/log/61_R3_conformal_upper_bound_result.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "edges": [{"source": "brain_log_61_r3_conformal_upper_bound_result_r3_conformal_upper_bound", "target": "brain_log_61_r3_conformal_upper_bound_result_conformal_u